<div class="page">
    <h2 class="section-heading">4.0 CONFIGURATION</h2>
    <div class="content-text" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
        The thermal dispersion line, TX and TS electronics module can be factory configured to accept power inputs of 90-130 VAC, 200-240 VAC at 50/60 Hz or 24 VDC. Maximum current draw with the dual switch point option is 180 mA and the maximum power draw is 5.5 Watts.
    </div>

    <div class="content-text" style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
        In addition, there are 6 jumper terminals JP2 through JP7 that allow you to set up the electronics for Level, Liquid Flow, Air Flow, Granular Solids, and Temperature.
    </div>

    <h3 class="sub-heading">JUMPER SETTINGS FOR TX - 1000 BOARD (BOTTOM BOARD) "DEFAULT"</h3>

